er\"><img src=\"https://klip-xtreme-frontend.s3.amazonaws.com/media/img/Icon-1-warranty-ENG.png\" alt=\"feature.title\" height=\"70px\" class=\"m-auto\"> <p class=\"mt-2 mb-0\">1 year limited</p> <small>warranty</small></p></div><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----><div class=\"vueperslides__arrows vueperslides__arrows--outside\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Previous\" class=\"vueperslides__arrow vueperslides__arrow--prev\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 9 18\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" d=\"m8 1 l-7 8 7 8\"></path></svg></button><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Next\" class=\"vueperslides__arrow vueperslides__arrow--next\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 9 18\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" d=\"m1 1 l7 8 -7 8\"></path></svg></button></div><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div></div> <div class=\"row col-12 col-xl-9 p-0 m-auto\"><div class=\"home-lg-section p-0 m-auto col-md-8 col-12\"><div class=\"product-features-box\"><div id=\"tablistcontainer\" class=\"tabs\"><!----><div class=\"\"><ul role=\"tablist\" id=\"tablistcontainer__BV_tab_controls_\" class=\"nav justify-content-center\"><!----><li role=\"presentation\" class=\"nav-item\"><a role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-setsize=\"4\" aria-posinset=\"1\" href=\"#\" target=\"_self\" class=\"nav-link active\" id=\"__BVID__17___BV_tab_button__\" aria-controls=\"__BVID__17\">Overview</a></li><li role=\"presentation\" class=\"nav-item\"><a id=\"specsTab___BV_tab_button__\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-setsize=\"4\" aria-posinset=\"2\" aria-controls=\"specsTab\" href=\"#\" target=\"_self\" class=\"nav-link\">Specs</a></li><li role=\"presentation\" class=\"nav-item\"><a role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-setsize=\"4\" aria-posinset=\"3\" href=\"#\" target=\"_self\" class=\"nav-link\" id=\"__BVID__37___BV_tab_button__\" aria-controls=\"__BVID__37\">Packaging</a></li><li role=\"presentation\" class=\"nav-item\"><a role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-setsize=\"4\" aria-posinset=\"4\" href=\"#\" target=\"_self\" class=\"nav-link\" id=\"__BVID__44___BV_tab_button__\" aria-controls=\"__BVID__44\">Downloads / Documents</a></li><!----></ul></div><div id=\"tablistcontainer__BV_tab_container_\" class=\"tab-content mt-3 tabs-container\"><div role=\"tabpanel\" aria-hidden=\"false\" class=\"tab-pane col-12 col-xl-10 m-auto overview active\" id=\"__BVID__17\" aria-labelledby=\"__BVID__17___BV_tab_button__\"><div class=\"overview-description\"><h2>Built for your way of life</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Light and spacious, this backpack will cover your mobility needs. Equipped with a USB port for charging your mobile devices on-the-go, and a well-padded pocket for a laptop of up to 15.6 inches, the Stendal backpack will fit all you need in your daily routine. Practical and stylish, this backpack will go with you in formal and casual occasions. It comes with several exterior pockets, an organizer compartment inside and an ultra-padded back side. You’ll find the Stendal backpack as tidy as it is ultra-comfortable.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Spacious and suitable for laptops up to 15.6 in.</li>\n<li>Three convenient frontal zipper pockets for easy access to frequently used items.</li>\n<li>USB port for charging your mobile devices on-the-go.*</li>\n<li>Additional interior organizer pocket.</li>\n<li>Ultra-padded back side for great comfort.</li>\n<li>Padded and adjustable shoulder straps.</li>\n<li>Pass-through strap for carry-on.</li>\n<li>Strong, long-lasting metal zippers.</li>\n<li>Made of high-quality, water-resistant polyester.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><small class=\"text-muted text-sm-left\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.44444px;\">*</span>Portable power bank not included.</small></p></div></div> <div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"specsTab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"specsTab___BV_tab_button__\" class=\"tab-pane col-12 m-auto specs\" style=\"display: none;\"><div id=\"specsContain